BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD THE REGENT OF MUSI RAWAS,

Considering:
Considering that women and children are among groups:

a. vulnerable, who tend to experience violence and therefore need to receive protection;

that violence against women and children

b. continues to increase, so protection efforts are needed; that all forms of violence against women and

c. children constitute violations of law and human rights and therefore their dignity and honor need to be protected and their right to life guaranteed in accordance with their nature and disposition without discrimination;

that based on the considerations as

d. referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

Observing that:

1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

